UX/UI Designer, focus on UX Design

Zagreb, Split, Budapest, hybrid

&nbsp;

DEPT® is a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, our 4,000+ specialists deliver growth invention services across Brand &amp; Media, Experience, Commerce, CRM, and Technology &amp; Data. We’re 50|50 tech and marketing, partner-led, and first to move. Clients include Google, Lufthansa, Meta, eBay, and OpenAI. We have been certified B Corp and Climate Neutral since 2021.

This role will be part of our Experience &amp; Engineering unit. We combine our skills in developing future-ready technical solutions with our expertise in creating beautiful designs to deliver exceptional and engaging digital experiences that build lasting relationships with our clients like Lufthansa, Inter Milan, Gant, BioNTech and Beiersdorf.

JOB PURPOSE

In this role, we would like to explore the possibility of opening a UX/UI department in our offices in Skopje, shaping top-notch experiences for international clients. You’ll collaborate with DEPT® teams across Europe, tackle complex design challenges, and push design quality to the next level. You're not just a strong designer, you’re a people-first person, who challenges conventions, and helps shape a thriving team culture. With hands-on design, you'll play a key role in putting our Macedonian design team on the map.

&nbsp;

KEY RESPONSIBILITIES

• Translate strategy and insights into well considered journeys, wireframes and visual interface designs rooted in robust design principles;

• Presenting your work to clients and stakeholders, handling input and managing feedback;

• Collaborate with global DEPT® colleagues to help international clients reach their digital goals;

• Foster a design-driven culture through knowledge sharing and best practices

&nbsp;

WHAT WE ARE LOOKING FOR

• 6+ years of experience as UX/UI designer at an agency or renowned brand;

• Experience with diverse digital design projects for large brands;

• A strong portfolio (website or PDF) demonstrating your experience and passion;

• A great communicator that is not afraid to take initiative;

• Experience with working in multidisciplinary teams;

• Experience with Figma and Design Systems is a must;

• Experience in motion design (Jitter) and AI tools is a big plus;

• Working proficiency in English;

WE OFFER

• Transparent career development and pay;

• A flexible, hybrid working policy&nbsp;

• A rewarding, supportive and healthy company culture.

• Supplemental and additional health insurance;

• Pension scheme: third pillar pension fund;&nbsp;

• Referral bonus program;

• Stay happy and healthy with a contribution to your health through the OpenUp platform, and a multisport programme;

• A reputation for doing good. DEPT® has been a Certified B Corp® since 2021 and named ‘Agency of the Year’ at both The Lovies and The Webby Awards.

• Awesome clients. Whether big or small, local or global - at DEPT® you’ll get the opportunity to work with clients of all sizes and across all industries. And we celebrate all of our successes together!

• The opportunity for possibility. We want to enable you to do what you do best and help you develop your skills further with training, development and certifications.

&nbsp;

WHO ARE WE?&nbsp;

We are a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, we create what is next by pioneering ideas, acting fast, and moving further because standing still just is not in our DNA.

We are drawn to people who stay curious, move with intent, and never stop inventing. Our culture runs on three values: better together, relentlessly curious, and get sh*t done. It is how we work, how we grow, and how we make things that matter.

